cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Casio calculator data logger: timed sensor sampling using
  host-wait windows in the Casio serial protocol
message: >-
  If you use this work, please cite the priority disclosure
  listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fenton
    given-names: Michael
    name-suffix: MRSNZ
